# Copy to .env (gitignored) and fill in as needed. The core path — validate, sweep,
# report, demo, retro, and the full pytest gate — needs NONE of these; they are only
# for the optional LLM narrative pass (`prng-lattice-lab report --narrate`, wired in
# report/synthesis.synthesize_narrative).

# API key for the optional narrative prose pass. Without it (or without the
# `narrative` extra: pip install -e .[narrative]) the deterministic report is still
# complete; --narrate discloses the skip in-report as a capability gap, never fakes prose.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
